---
emassWrtTable OBJECT-TYPE
    SYNTAX      SEQUENCE OF EmassWrtEntry
    MAX-ACCESS  not-accessible
    STATUS      current
    DESCRIPTION "EMASS writer information table."
    ::= { emassConfig 2 }

